            "value": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "committing write",
      "definition": "使预先准备的完整新版本一次性对读者可见的指针写。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "grace period",
      "definition": "足以保证所有旧读侧临界区已经结束的等待区间。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "call_rcu",
      "definition": "登记回调，在 grace period 后异步执行释放等动作的写侧接口。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "common_misconceptions": [
    {
      "misconception": "读写锁的读路径是纯读，不会争用缓存行。",
      "correction": "读锁通常更新共享读者计数，仍会产生写和缓存失效。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "RCU 写者可以原地逐字段修改对象。",
      "correction": "典型 RCU 先准备副本，再通过单指针写发布完整版本。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "从列表摘除对象后可以立即 free。",
      "correction": "已有读者可能仍持旧指针，必须等待 grace period。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "RCU 适用于所有共享结构。",
      "correction": "写频繁、引用跨睡眠、需要双向一致扫描或不能单写提交的结构通常不适合。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-23-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
